{# Key-insight callout: the ST-07B payoff treatment — a distinct accent-ruled
   TINT panel carrying a LARGER italic insight line. A heavier, more editorial
   cousin of callout_panel: an accent left-rule sets the insight apart, the body
   sets in a large italic display-adjacent size, and the panel is a tint fill.
   Under the c-key-insight namespace; the token-only look (accent rule, tint fill,
   large italic) lives in styles/components.css.

   text   the insight line (plain or pre-rendered trusted HTML).
   label  OPTIONAL small uppercase label above the insight (e.g. "Kernaussage").

   GRACEFUL: an empty/blank text renders NOTHING. #}
{% macro key_insight(text, label='') -%}
{% if text %}
<figure class="c-key-insight">
  {% if label %}<div class="c-key-insight__label">{{ label }}</div>{% endif %}
  <blockquote class="c-key-insight__body">{{ text }}</blockquote>
</figure>
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
